<title>ITALY: Ambroveneto SpA H1 96 net profit up 28 pct.</title>
<headline>Ambroveneto SpA H1 96 net profit up 28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>Parent company net profit  92  vs up 28 percent  </p>
<p>    Parent gross operating profit    384   vs  331</p>
<p>    Consolidated net profit	     85   vs   53</p>
<p>    Cons gross operating profit	419   vs  352</p>
<p>    Parent net interest income	 817   vs  829</p>
<p>    Parent service margin		445   vs  338</p>
<p>    Parent operating income	    262   vs  up 8 pct</p>
<p>    Client deposits		   31,150   vs  up 13 pct</p>
<p>    Indirect deposits		 48,850   vs  up 14 pct</p>
<p>    Total deposits		    80,000   vs  up 13.5 pct</p>
<p>    Client loans			28,000   vs  up 15 pct</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
